PTX cas.b128
"atom.cas.b128 is one atomic operation (D6): the same as a scalar CAS. Expected: forbidden."
{
x=0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0                        | P1@cta 1,gpu 0                        ;
 atom.relaxed.gpu.cas.b128 r0, x, 0, 1 | atom.relaxed.gpu.cas.b128 r1, x, 0, 2 ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
